{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日，<strong>零跑科技創始人、董事長兼CEO朱江明與歐寶CEO Florian Huettl正式籤署合作協議，雙方將共同開發一款全新的C級SUV車型，新車預計2028年正式開啓銷售，並在西班牙薩拉戈薩工廠生產。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587300.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.111540+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:07:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_hash":"9fe790bd0f04f6c8ba155c5c0987238105553114ad49b6de76d1b39d86bd1130","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}